  "name": "biscuit",
  "description": "A decentralized authentication and authorization token system designed for offline-capable policy enforcement through attenuated capabilities. It leverages a logic-based language derived from Datalog to express facts, rules, and caveats within cryptographically secured, chained blocks. The system supports programmatic delegation and fine-grained access control using advanced primitives such as Ristretto-based Schnorr signatures and Verifiable Random Functions.",
